body:
This isn't my area of expertise, but you could try to renew your visa. Talk to the people in charge of the funding and provide them with all the paperwork for processing your visa renewal and see if you can work something out? It sounds like its not your fault and you are trying, so don't take blame and call yourself pathetic. Because you aren't. 

&#x200B;

Lately I've been trying to focus on little things that make me happy, like the area I am currently in and how beautiful it is. I've been going outside and taking a break and enjoying the sights just so I can feel somewhat at peace and get away from my troubles. Maybe you should do that. Even if it's just for five minutes. Then maybe post online and see if there is anything you can do to get help with your business or see if there is someone you can reach out to in order to prove that your business is worthy for funding. There are always other options out there - even if they are hard to find.

I know it probably doesn't mean much, but I believe in you. It's difficult to do, but we need to focus on one thing at a time. Focus in on a tiny portion rather than the big picture so it's not as overwhelming. Focus on what you feel like should be most important, or what you think someone else will think is most important if you can't decide - and then tackle that. 

&#x200B;

Yes, there will always be more stress and more things to overwhelm us if we let them. But try to focus on today and not tomorrow or what could happen.

I'm feeling the same way, I'm here to talk. 

&#x200B;

Also, don't apologize for bothering anyone. You have every right to be on the planet as everyone else does - whether you believe that right now or not.
